WEBVTT

00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:30.485
[In the Green: The Business
of Climate Action]

00:00:31.569 --> 00:00:34.238
[Presented by TED Countdown
and The Climate Pledge]

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.199
[Katie McGinty
Company: Johnson Controls]

00:00:36.199 --> 00:00:37.742
[Sector: Buildings
Location: USA]

00:00:37.784 --> 00:00:43.581
Buildings contribute about 40 percent
of global greenhouse gas emissions.

00:00:43.623 --> 00:00:46.542
They represent the biggest growing piece

00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:50.505
of electricity consumption
and demand in the world.

00:00:50.505 --> 00:00:54.050
We're not cracking
this climate change challenge

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:57.011
unless we decarbonize those buildings.

00:00:58.012 --> 00:00:59.472
When you look at a building,

00:00:59.472 --> 00:01:03.768
there are key aspects of it
that enable it to run.